<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Hi {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><font size="2">File Reference - {!Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}</font></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Thank you for your patience while we assessed your claim.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b>Your replacement bag has been approved&nbsp;</b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b><br></b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">We’ve determined that your damaged bag is unsuitable for repair and would like to offer you a replacement.&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">We’ve partnered up with Delsey - a Paris-based supplier trusted by airline crew around the world - enabling us to offer tamper-proof bags with a five-year warranty equipped with TSA locks.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b>Pick out your new Delsey bag .</b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b><br></b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">You're all set for a replacement bag similar in size and style as your old one - just choose your favourite from the&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); transition-duration: 0.1s; transition-timing-function: linear; transition-property: color; cursor: pointer; font-size: 10pt;"><a href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/#900000010OOK/a/Mo0000015ye5/1BX1IfkNv78MEbun44YHPVfDg6WZMvPjUB.634fKYbo">Qantas Delsey Brochure</a></span></font>&nbsp;<span style="font-size: small;">and select the following:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Baggage type (e.g., Moncey, Clavel)&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Size (in cms)&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Colour (Where the colour selected is unavailable, we'll replace it with an Anthracite coloured baggage)&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b>Delivery of your replacement&nbsp;</b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><b><br></b></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Please complete the attached <b>Replacement Baggage Release Form</b> (need to add the form here) and return it by replying to this email along with your baggage selection.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Make sure you provide a residential or business address, as replacement bags can't be delivered to a PO Box.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Your replacement bag will be delivered during business hours between 9:00am to 5:00pm, and since we're unable to leave the delivery unattended, please make sure someone is available to receive it.&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">We look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.&nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></p><p style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced. We are confident that you will be delighted with your new baggage and thank you again for your understanding.&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: small;">Kind regards</span></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
